# `collision`: every tag of a family is declared in its family's module (Type System ch. 2),
# so a program adds no tag to a family of the prelude's; the error stands at the program's
# tag. Written by Claude on the claude-bugs branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*

tag Ui.Knob of Element !Nat:
    $label: Text

@main: @unit
@main:
    Ui.Knob($label=$"a")
